(Skill Mentor is a personalized skill learning and mentoring platform designed for students and self-learners.) Tj
T* (Unlike traditional e-learning platforms that focus purely on content delivery, Skill Mentor acts as a personal AI) Tj
T* (mentor for every learner, guiding them through learning, practice, revision, and assessment for each skill they) Tj
T* (choose to develop. Through Skill Mentor, learners interact with a dedicated AI assistant that provides) Tj
T* (curriculum-aligned explanations, adaptive assignments, and revision aids for every subject or skill they are) Tj
T* (studying.) Tj
