(Skill Mentor is a single, unified learning ecosystem consisting of various functional subcomponents. This) Tj
T* (software allows the learner to access a personalised AI mentor for every skill remotely through a web) Tj
T* (application. This software also allows the learner to perform various other functions apart from just learning a) Tj
T* (skill, such as doubt clarification, assignment generation, and revision aid creation. Some of its core software) Tj
T* (components are the skill-tracking module, the AI mentor engine, the assignment generator, the learning-aid) Tj
T* (generator, the collaboration module, and the analytics dashboard.) Tj
ET
