BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
56.6929133858267775 371.3388188976377364 Td
(The major functions that Skill Mentor performs are described as follows: -) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
68.031496062992133 342.9923622047243725 Td
(• Skill Selection: The dashboard provides the learner with a list of skills from which they can select any one in) Tj
T* (order to begin a learning session. After skill selection, the learner is prompted with an option to set the) Tj
T* (selected skill as their default focus so that they are not shown the selection screen in future sessions, thus) Tj
T* (making the experience a bit faster. The learner also has the freedom to switch to a different skill mentioned in) Tj
T* (the list at any point during that session.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
68.031496062992133 274.9608661417322537 Td
(• Skill Profile Management: The various functions that a learner can perform within their skill profile are as) Tj
T* (follows: - Proficiency Level: - The learner has the freedom to set or update their current proficiency level for) Tj
T* (the selected skill, i.e., whether they are a beginner, intermediate, or advanced learner.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
68.031496062992133 232.4411811023621794 Td
(• Doubt Clarification: The software allows the learner to type or select the doubt they want clarified, and the AI) Tj
T* (mentor responds with a step-by-step, example-based explanation aligned with the reference textbook for that) Tj
T* (skill.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
68.031496062992133 189.9214960629919915 Td
(• Assignment Generation: The proficiency level and topic for which the learner wants an assignment is then) Tj
T* (specified by the learner, and the system generates practice questions that progress from easy to advanced.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
68.031496062992133 148.8191338582676053 Td
(• Learning Aid Generation: Learning aid generation shall be done on request. After selecting the topic and the) Tj
T* (type of aid required, the learner receives a mind map, mnemonic, or short summary that is generated and) Tj
T* (displayed within the session.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
68.031496062992133 106.2994488188975311 Td
(• Multi-Skill Linking: Multi-skill linking shall be facilitated between any two or more skills added to the learner’s) Tj
T* (profile, for example linking a programming skill and a mathematics skill for interdisciplinary assignments.) Tj
ET
